[{"id":165713476,"discussion_id":"83a82c13dc7214c46c6123436ae3eaa40316a1fd","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| mc2 | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo), [*liuboxi*](https://gitcode.com/liuboxi) (2/2) | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n ryan_li, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-19T11:10:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-25T11:15:27+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165713510,"discussion_id":"b93e70e771f48f91adc8b858a46037ea90b3ab89","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-19T11:10:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T11:10:57+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165715379,"discussion_id":"6e622356e7502dac16611e729b37945f973468a7","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR集中修复了多个算子（包括MatMulV3、AllGatherMatmul、MatmulAlltoAll、MatmulReduceScatter、MoE相关算子等）中存在的属性数据类型不匹配问题。核心问题是代码在从算子属性中读取整型参数（如`commTurn`、`blockSize`、`gatherIndex`、`HF32`标志、量化模式及MoE相关配置参数）时，错误地使用了`int`（32位）类型的指针，而属性实际存储为`int64_t`（64位）类型。这可能导致在大数值场景下发生数据截断、内存访问越界或未定义行为，进而影响算子执行的正确性、稳定性和跨平台兼容性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案统一将相关函数中通过`GetAttrPointer`获取属性值的模板参数从`int`更正为`int64_t`，确保指针类型与属性实际存储类型一致。涉及的属性广泛，包括通信控制参数（`commTurn`, `blockSize`）、配置参数（`gatherIndex`, `HF32`标志、`epWorldSize`, `moeExpertNum`等）以及量化模式参数（`x1_quant_mode`, `commQuantMode`等）。同时，修正了与之配套的错误检查逻辑（如将条件判断从“不等于0”改为“等于0”）和日志打印格式字符串（如将`%d`改为`%ld`），以匹配`int64_t`类型。此修改消除了潜在的类型安全风险，提升了代码健壮性。","created_at":"2026-03-19T11:19:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T11:19:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165729046,"discussion_id":"44c3c29d31601e39f40bbd4bfdd4a95ec2baf63f","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-19T14:07:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T14:07:48+08:00","user":{"id":"68848931f519ba33f1cf1993","login":"ryan_li","object_id":"68848931f519ba33f1cf1993","name":"liyang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ryan_li"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165729192,"discussion_id":"11b567a897b34ae6a10f6f51e20f0e754102c9a6","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunI